          "id": "4e95cd36465c679c90f1e745f3e9eadc5626e3d4",
          "message": "fix(kernel): preserve NURBS section anchors across scales (#304)\n\n* fix(kernel): qualify offset sphere-cylinder boolean seams\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): qualify offset torus-sphere boolean seams\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): preserve boolean material across model scales\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): use length units for straight-edge split bands\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(kernel): qualify restored large-scale tangent booleans\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): retain small tools in anisotropic booleans\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): measure analytic arc split bands in model space\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): preserve NURBS section anchors across scales\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(kernel): reconcile planar NURBS coincidence partitions\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: drop duplicated roadmap paragraph from the merge\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>",
