          "distinct": true,
          "id": "40d8dc9f5a3483f3cf23cce47516fb2e7884cc38",
          "message": "fix(io): read degenerate degree-1 two-point splines as Lines (#473)\n\nHOOPS Exchange writes straight solid sides as degree-1 two-point\nB_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS instead of LINE (Scale Platform v1 edges\n127/135). That spelling is exactly the control chord, so normalize it\nto EdgeCurve::Line, whose geometry the edge vertices determine.\nRouting it through untrimmed-NURBS domain recovery instead projects\nshared vertices onto the carrier and refuses spacings the identical\nLINE spelling accepts (Scale edge 128: 1.619256e-3 mm vs 1.0e-5 mm\nlocal cap).\n\nThe match is exact (degree 1, two control points, bit-exact unit\nweights, mirroring the polynomial proof in\nuniquely_witnessed_nurbs_domain); rational and multi-span splines\nstay NURBS. Adds a sanitized box regression fixture mirroring the\nScale off-chord vertex plus fail-closed cubic coverage.\n\nSigned-off-by: petertoday <171875562+petertoday@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-16T10:20:34-04:00",
          "tree_id": "063052e3bb70e33795ba8904397554dccd10264d",
          "url": "https://github.com/esaueng/remus/commit/40d8dc9f5a3483f3cf23cce47516fb2e7884cc38"
