          "id": "0afe6bb7142a890acd2e187f1d0117e448143c2c",
          "message": "ci: retire the unused owner-PR workflow and runner selector (#1193)\n\n## Change\n\n`owner-pr.yml` is a reusable workflow that nothing calls.\n`select-runner.yml`, the availability selector it calls, has no other\ncaller. Fleet jobs pick their runner from `vars.CI_FLEET_TARGET` in each\njob's `runs-on` expression, so `.github/ci-fleet.md` described a\nselector-based routing that no workflow actually performs.\n\n- **Deleted:** `.github/workflows/owner-pr.yml` (263 lines) and\n`.github/workflows/select-runner.yml` (92 lines).\n- **`.github/ci-fleet.md`** rewritten for the routing that actually\nruns: static `CI_FLEET_TARGET` per job, the fleet guard, and no\navailability probing. It records that `REMUS_OWNER_PR_VPS_ENABLED` was\nread only by `owner-pr.yml` and is now unused.\n- **`docs/owner-pr-ci.md`:** the policy-verification paragraph now names\nthe guard's owner policy test and the active `fleet-ci` callee from\n`.github/fleet-workflows.json`.\n- **Tests.** The pinned CI callee runs these four scripts by name, so\nthey stay and are retargeted:\n- `test-owner-pr-policy.py` exercises the same owner identity policy in\n`.github/actions/fleet-guard/action.yml`, which every fleet job runs.\nIts structural tests of the deleted job became\n`test_guard_fails_closed_and_runs_only_on_self_hosted_prs`.\n- `test-fleet-runner-policy.py` checks the runner tables in the fleet\nguard and `trusted-vps.yml`.\n- `test-fleet-selector.py` keeps its legacy-label and pilot checks and\nadds `test_retired_selector_and_owner_workflows_stay_retired`.\n- `test-owner-pr-routing.py` drops `test_vps_preserves_native_commands`,\nthe one test of the deleted job.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Every policy script `fleet-ci-v3.yml` invokes passes locally,\nincluding the four above, `test_fleet_workflows.py`,\n`test-direct-fleet.py` and `test-ubuntu-ci-routing.py`.\n`classify-ci-changes.py` is not a test; it needs CI arguments.\n- `scripts/check-doc-paths.sh` and `actionlint` pass.\n- `git grep` finds no remaining reference to either file outside the\nretirement notes and the tests that assert they stay deleted.\n\n## Compatibility and risks\n\n- **Files deleted:** `owner-pr.yml` and `select-runner.yml`. Old\nimmutable pins in past runs still resolve from history. No current\ncaller, required check or ruleset names either workflow.\n- **Repository variable:** `REMUS_OWNER_PR_VPS_ENABLED` is now unused\nand can be removed from the repository settings.\n- No change to kernel code, file formats, units, tolerances or\ndependencies.\n\n## WASM module tier\n\nNone.\n\n---\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_01RAFdKbytobmE6B5tmrSS1Z)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
