          "message": "docs(ci): record that the owner-PR VPS variable was removed (#1198)\n\n## Change\n\n`.github/ci-fleet.md` said `REMUS_OWNER_PR_VPS_ENABLED` \"is now unused\".\nThe variable has now been deleted from the repository's Actions\nvariables. #1193 retired `owner-pr.yml`, which was its only reader. The\nnote now says it was removed on 2026-10-20.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git grep REMUS_OWNER_PR_VPS_ENABLED` on main finds only this note; no\nworkflow reads it.\n- `test_fleet_workflows.py`, `test-fleet-selector.py`,\n`test-fleet-runner-policy.py`, `test-owner-pr-routing.py` and\n`scripts/check-doc-paths.sh` pass locally.\n\n## Compatibility and risks\n\nDocumentation only.\n\n## WASM module tier\n\nNone.\n\n---\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_01RAFdKbytobmE6B5tmrSS1Z)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
