          "distinct": false,
          "id": "e287c58af27bee6bcae94e9a712aaabec6252b5e",
          "message": "feat(sketch): link planar external lines through construction history (#1326)\n\nAdds planar GCS sketch attachments and external straight-line inputs\ndriven by construction-derived face, edge and endpoint references.\nQualified parallel face edits refresh fixed external inputs before\nsolve/DOF analysis; reversed edge storage preserves endpoint identity.\nSplit, deleted, ambiguous and inferred references refuse with stable\nmachine-readable details, retaining the last valid sketch. Malformed\ninputs report invalid_input, while unsupported geometry/evolution\nreports unsupported.\n\nThe direct and both batch APIs expose gcsAttachToFace,\ngcsAddExternalLine and gcsResolveRefs. Checkpoints retain the attachment\nand external inputs; direct setters cannot alter linked endpoints.\nSuccessful linked-input refresh establishes the detailed solver's\nrollback baseline; free parameters restore on nonconvergence, while\nthrown errors restore the entire pre-call sketch. Rotating attachments,\ncurved sources and full sketch save/load remain outside this bounded\nP-Class 6.6 increment.\n\nValidation at source 1fd1246b09f9093b123b7b45bcb37e1b9f8d4356: 46 native\ntests passed (six linked-operation cases, six linked binding contracts,\n34 existing GCS binding tests), with ordinary all-target/all-feature\nworkspace hooks and focused\nAPI/module-map/documentation/boundary/privacy checks. Canonical cargo\nxtask wasm-build, the complete fresh smoke suite and complete\ninstalled-tarball consumer suite passed. The strengthened linked\nworkflow also passed all three API routes on fresh and separately\ninstalled packages, including error taxonomy, identity refusal and\nindependent nonconvergence residuals. All eight published files per\nmodule matched generated bytes and modes. Optimized kernel size is\n10,876,429 bytes (+40,821 vs the committed base); the IO binary is\nunchanged. Hosted CI remains pending. No dependencies or committed\npackages changed.\n\nWASM-Size: linked planar sketch references, Tier: core (edits live GCS\nstate, persistent references and checkpoints).",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:39:43Z",
          "tree_id": "aa87faaa8aa62bc37d1583ebfcccbc71d4589740",
          "url": "https://github.com/esaueng/remus/commit/e287c58af27bee6bcae94e9a712aaabec6252b5e"
